  "expense_characteristics": {
    "K_S2a": "k4_states repeated calibration/ref forwards; k4_run_0..5 and k6c_* use lens rollouts. run_cells batches16cells×10seeds×2streams, but eachstep copies metrics and many set-readouts to CPU; V1 DLA all-layer per-set computations.",
    "K_S2b": "k6e_* uses small16-unit cells with one seed,2streams,24steps, many H/RS/MC conditions; G-K16 can double2→4 keys. CPU/GPU synchronization and Python overhead are relevant.",
